"AgT-xm8tx-A":`<h4>📝 متن ویدیو (انگلیسی — نمونه)</h4>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(0)">0:00</span><span>Before you take a patient's blood pressure, make sure you're not making these seven common mistakes. Number seven: documenting with odd numbers… round to the nearest 2 mmHg.</span></div>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(129)">2:09</span><span>…white coat syndrome… a patient nervous in the office may have normal readings at home — always consider context before treatment.</span></div>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(252)">4:12</span><span>…palpate first to avoid a falsely low systolic (auscultatory gap)… note where the pulse disappears, then listen for Korotkoff sounds.</span></div>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(358)">5:58</span><span>…gather equipment, palms up, cuff 1 inch above the elbow bend… "righty tighty"… inflate 30 above palpated systolic, deflate at 2 mmHg per second.</span></div>
<p style="color:var(--mut2);font-size:.75rem;margin-top:10px">متن کامل (۲۴۳ بخش، ۹ دقیقه) در دیتابیس ذخیره می‌شود.</p>`,
"3eKThL40ORQ":`<h4>📝 متن ویدیو (انگلیسی — نمونه)</h4>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(0)">0:00</span><span>Hey everyone, it's Nurse Sarah… GI feeding tubes, specifically surgically inserted ones like the G-tube and J-tube… placed through the skin for the long term.</span></div>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(73)">1:13</span><span>…PEG and RIG methods… long G-tube vs low-profile buttons… check the balloon and external bumper daily.</span></div>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(476)">7:56</span><span>…J-tube feeds into the jejunum… dumping syndrome risk… rotate the tube, clean the stoma, watch for hypergranulation.</span></div>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(987)">16:27</span><span>…recheck placement… pH 1–5 in the stomach… flush before and after meds with 30–60 mL syringe… crush only crushable forms.</span></div>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(1338)">22:18</span><span>…sterile dressing, notify the provider for dislodgement… never check residuals on J-tubes routinely — aspiration risk.</span></div>
<p style="color:var(--mut2);font-size:.75rem;margin-top:10px">متن کامل (۶۶۹ بخش، ۲۴ دقیقه) در دیتابیس ذخیره می‌شود.</p>`,
"BdCKkgnk8-E":`<h4>📝 متن ویدیو (انگلیسی — نمونه)</h4>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(0)">0:00</span><span>Hey everyone, it's Nurse Sarah… key test concepts on barrier contraceptives… they block sperm from entering the cervix — and do not alter hormones.</span></div>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(106)">1:46</span><span>…male condoms: check expiration, no oil-based lubricants, pinch the tip… female condoms do not protect as well against STIs.</span></div>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(198)">3:18</span><span>…spermicides with nonoxynol-9… must be inserted before intercourse… never used alone — pair with a barrier method.</span></div>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(297)">4:57</span><span>…the diaphragm must stay in for at least 6 hours after intercourse… refit after childbirth or weight change… watch for toxic shock: fever, rash, hypotension.</span></div>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(461)">7:41</span><span>…FemCap cervical cap: needs spermicide, takes hours to work… inspect for cracks… replace yearly.</span></div>
<p style="color:var(--mut2);font-size:.75rem;margin-top:10px">متن کامل (۲۵۵ بخش، ۱۰ دقیقه) در دیتابیس ذخیره می‌شود.</p>`,
"qfbdF4t7WXg":`<h4>📝 متن ویدیو (انگلیسی — نمونه)</h4>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(0)">0:00</span><span>Hey everyone, it's Nurse Sarah… parenteral versus enteral nutrition… ordered when patients can't meet needs by eating — e.g. impaired swallowing.</span></div>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(236)">3:56</span><span>…TPN contains lots of dextrose — hypertonic, central line only… PPN is isotonic-ish for short-term peripheral use… monitor sites closely.</span></div>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(433)">7:13</span><span>…during therapy watch glucose and insulin… feedings given too quickly cause dumping… refeeding syndrome drops phosphate — start slow.</span></div>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(727)">12:07</span><span>…basilar skull injury — no NG tube… small-bore for meds and feeds… long-term patients need PEG instead.</span></div>
<div class="tr-row"><span class="ch-t" onclick="seek(867)">14:27</span><span>…always check placement — aspirate and pH… residual trends signal intolerance… oral care even when NPO.</span></div>
<p style="color:var(--mut2);font-size:.75rem;margin-top:10px">متن کامل (۴۳۵ بخش، ۱۶ دقیقه) در دیتابیس ذخیره می‌شود.</p>`
